{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1496382-titanic-mutations","id":1496382,"title":"Titanic Mutations","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-11-07T02:16:31-08:00","id":1496382,"title":"Titanic Mutations","content":"On pg. 101 of Saints and Monsters, the rules say that a player may subsititue a &quot;dot&quot; of Knacks or Boons, for a dot of Titanic Mutation. The issue with that of course is, Knacks and Boons do not come with &quot;dot&quot; costs attached. My feeling would be to convert these on a 1-1 scale. A Mortal knack is one dot, a Boon is one dot. But still, this doesnt quite feel right. Does anyone else have a reading suggestion here? Or perhaps this has been clarified elsewhere and I've missed it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24183-thevoiceoftreason","name":"thevoiceoftreason","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24183_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-07T03:07:20-08:00","id":1496384,"title":"","content":"I had the same issue.<br /> <br /> 1 dot = 1 Knack or 1 Boon.<br /> It is just to start, once you have XP enough to buy it, you buy the Boom or Knack back and use it as usual (particularly the boom)<br /> <br /> Another option is to allow the 4 dots of Birthrights or 2 Knacks you gain in the step nine of character creation to let you get 2 dots of Titanic Mutations.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-07T21:12:57-08:00","id":1496456,"title":"","content":"Okay for sure, next point of order then would be how to spend those dots. On pg. 103 the book mentions that some benefits provided by a Titanic Mutation cost multiple dots, then it goes on to list a number of benefits... with no dot costs attached. Oh man. So my instinct here would be to price these similarly to the manners by which you can access similar benefits through Birthrights. But if that's the case; why have the Titanic Mutation system work so differently from Birthrights in the first place. Pretty odd, I dig the idea behind this, but it feels like it didnt quite get finished in the mechancis department.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24183-thevoiceoftreason","name":"thevoiceoftreason","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24183_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-08T04:06:52-08:00","id":1496480,"title":"","content":"It is confusing or sure. I personally would make the Mutation a Birthright and enjoy all the already written and balanced rules for them\u2026 but I am not a dev.<br /> Honestly, go for a easy way and balance as you see to fit, or just consider all the non-defined costs as 1.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-07T08:52:18-08:00","id":1499067,"title":"","content":"I have the same. Isn't it supposed to be like this?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27685-rutillo","name":"Rutillo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27685_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[